BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Trainspotting (1996)
DTSTART:20260608T020000Z
DTEND:20260608T040000Z
DTSTAMP:20260608T020000Z
UID:7ZjoFCK5w3
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 103 mins (1h43m)\n\n30th Anniversary screening. Rent
 on (Ewan McGregor)\, deeply immersed in the Edinburgh drug scene\, tries t
 o clean up and get out\, despite the allure of the drugs and influence of 
 friends. 4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/trains
 potting\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
